WEBVTT

00:02.797 --> 00:04.837
Will you bump fists with me?

00:05.837 --> 00:06.837
Yeah.

00:24.837 --> 00:26.467
Yeah, let's try it!

00:26.967 --> 00:29.007
There's nothing we can't do
if we borrow Nine Tails'...

00:29.087 --> 00:31.127
I mean, Kurama's power.

00:31.217 --> 00:32.177
All right!

00:32.257 --> 00:34.797
Then let's all four of us join forces!

00:35.127 --> 00:36.627
All four of us, eh?

00:36.837 --> 00:39.007
You treat us like we're human too.

00:39.087 --> 00:41.467
What kind of childrearing
has led to this, eh?

00:45.627 --> 00:46.377
Naruto...

00:46.717 --> 00:47.587
Huh?

00:48.007 --> 00:51.967
I wish there was more time
to talk to the grown-up you!

00:52.047 --> 00:54.717
Guys don't need to talk!

00:54.927 --> 00:56.427
I already know!

01:01.967 --> 01:05.717
I... already met Mom's chakra...

01:06.967 --> 01:10.627
What you want to say is the same
as my nagging mom, right?!

01:11.007 --> 01:12.627
I already know!

01:31.337 --> 01:35.117
<i>This feeling is so familiar...</i>

01:36.597 --> 01:38.927
<i>Even though we're out of options,</i>

01:39.017 --> 01:41.727
<i>it feels like we can</i>
<i>accomplish anything...</i>

01:42.977 --> 01:49.517
<i>That's right! It's just like</i>
<i>when I was with Kushina!</i>

01:58.767 --> 02:00.887
I feel power welling up inside me!

02:01.227 --> 02:02.677
Let's go!

02:04.307 --> 02:06.307
<i>Naruto's got this much chakra?</i>

02:07.017 --> 02:09.677
Naruto! Letting out a shout
and showing off

02:09.767 --> 02:11.637
is all well and good...

02:11.807 --> 02:13.767
but don't tell me
you've already forgotten...

02:14.227 --> 02:17.847
that nothing other than
Sage Jutsu works against him?

02:18.227 --> 02:19.807
I know you're not an idiot!

02:30.057 --> 02:32.427
That's right!

02:32.517 --> 02:35.427
You're a bigger idiot
than my elder brother!

02:36.177 --> 02:39.557
<i>All that chakra and</i>
<i>it's being wasted on him...</i>

02:39.677 --> 02:42.927
<i>Or perhaps this isn't quite</i>
<i>the same feeling...</i>

02:46.807 --> 02:52.227
It looks like you've surpassed
all the previous Hokage, in stupidity!

02:52.347 --> 02:56.097
Shut up! Stupid, stupid Kurama!

02:57.267 --> 02:59.807
Fools are easily liked
and trusted by others.

03:00.637 --> 03:04.427
It'll be all right.
Don't worry about it.

03:05.517 --> 03:08.227
I-I'm not worried that I'm an idiot!

03:08.767 --> 03:10.227
I'm not talking about that.

03:10.307 --> 03:11.097
Huh?

03:11.177 --> 03:14.557
I'm saying that you might
be able to go into Sage Mode

03:14.637 --> 03:16.637
while you're in that state.

03:18.227 --> 03:22.637
Listen up... You've probably
already forgotten,

03:22.727 --> 03:26.977
but during your final battle
with Pain, Nagato...

03:30.347 --> 03:34.727
I got so mad by what he was saying
that my chakra leaked out,

03:34.807 --> 03:38.557
even though you were
in Sage Mode at that time.

03:38.637 --> 03:45.557
My power and your Sage Power
actually managed to synchronize.

03:49.177 --> 03:51.267
Did something like that
happen back then...?

04:03.807 --> 04:07.597
You say that, but back when
I was undergoing Sage Training,

04:07.677 --> 04:10.637
you interfered with Gramps Sage's
Sage Jutsu, remember?

04:10.637 --> 04:14.767
That's because I had no interest
in sharing the same space with toads!

04:15.597 --> 04:20.727
Besides, it really pissed me off
that you would rely on Sage Jutsu

04:20.807 --> 04:22.517
when you had my chakra.

04:25.097 --> 04:27.267
You stubborn bastard!

04:27.517 --> 04:29.637
You're the stubborn one!

04:30.137 --> 04:31.727
Anyway, what I'm trying to say is,

04:31.807 --> 04:34.517
that I'm willing to let you use

04:34.597 --> 04:36.847
both my power and
Sage Power right now.

04:37.057 --> 04:39.767
What's stubborn about that,
damn it?!

04:40.977 --> 04:43.637
You just can't be up front about
your feelings, can you?

04:43.727 --> 04:47.307
You bastard! You've been
making fun of me a lot lately!

04:50.807 --> 04:54.227
It's not like that...
It's out of familiarity...

04:58.057 --> 05:00.807
Using Tailed Beast State with
Sage Jutsu at the same time, huh...

05:01.767 --> 05:04.177
You've got the same me
inside you as your son.

05:04.427 --> 05:07.597
You should be able to provide him
with powerful support.

05:07.927 --> 05:08.887
Yeah...

05:10.767 --> 05:12.677
I already know that!

05:21.387 --> 05:23.137
<i>I'll have some jutsu prepared too!</i>

05:25.677 --> 05:29.097
<i>I'm absorbing Nature Energy</i>
<i>a lot faster in this state.</i>

05:40.677 --> 05:41.347
All right!

