07:28.177 --> 07:32.847
The Divine Tree

07:39.237 --> 07:42.067
Naruto, add Sage Jutsu
to the Rasengan!

07:42.147 --> 07:43.277
Okay!

07:44.197 --> 07:45.527
Old Man Second!

07:47.107 --> 07:48.197
Let's do it!

07:50.897 --> 07:52.147
Just forge ahead!

07:52.857 --> 07:56.147
We'll ward off his attacks
with our chakra!

08:08.107 --> 08:09.607
– Rasengan!
– Rasengan!

08:46.197 --> 08:48.447
That black thing sure is solid!

08:49.147 --> 08:50.237
Damn it...

08:50.357 --> 08:52.237
He blocked us this time!

08:53.067 --> 08:54.857
He predicted our attack...

08:55.237 --> 08:58.067
Using only the Flying Raijin
in our strategy isn't enough.

08:58.277 --> 09:01.147
Our only option is to destroy
that black thing!

09:01.857 --> 09:02.737
But how?

09:03.397 --> 09:05.817
All right, next up...

09:06.067 --> 09:10.147
Let's try adding Sage Jutsu
to a Tailed Beast Bomb!

09:11.147 --> 09:12.527
All right, excellent idea!

09:13.987 --> 09:18.027
<i>You might just surpass</i>
<i>my Elder Brother as Hokage...</i>

09:23.027 --> 09:25.027
Hey, other Kurama! You help too!

09:25.357 --> 09:27.147
I like the sound of that!

09:28.107 --> 09:29.237
<i>I thought so...</i>

09:31.527 --> 09:33.147
<i>This is a familiar feeling,</i>
<i>after all!</i>

09:44.647 --> 09:46.817
<i>This is what Naruto is</i>
<i>capable of now?</i>

09:47.777 --> 09:50.237
<i>He's able to control this much</i>
<i>chakra perfectly...</i>

09:52.027 --> 09:54.447
<i>How far will you...</i>

10:06.527 --> 10:09.567
<i>There's no harm</i>
<i>in taking measures early.</i>

10:17.237 --> 10:19.237
W-What's that?!

10:25.237 --> 10:28.737
<i>He's starting</i>
<i>the Infinite Tsukuyomi already?!</i>

10:51.007 --> 10:53.047
He spit out the Ten Tails?

10:53.127 --> 10:55.717
Be careful. I have
a bad feeling about this.

11:32.967 --> 11:35.127
I'll suspend the barrier for now.

11:42.627 --> 11:43.877
The barrier is disappearing!

11:44.757 --> 11:47.377
Now we can fight alongside Naruto
and the others!

12:12.507 --> 12:13.917
<i>Th-This is—!</i>

12:24.257 --> 12:25.377
What?!

12:32.297 --> 12:36.167
Run! It will absorb all your chakra
in one swoop!

12:42.417 --> 12:44.007
It's coming after us one by one!

12:44.087 --> 12:45.877
But why...?!

12:49.717 --> 12:55.047
Why...?! Why do I get so many
coming at me, huh?

12:55.127 --> 12:57.087
Fool... Ya fool!

12:57.587 --> 13:00.837
This is the tree of God.
It's called the Divine Tree!

13:01.217 --> 13:03.087
It's the Ten Tails' final form!

13:03.587 --> 13:08.007
It knows that you have
more chakra than everyone else!

13:08.377 --> 13:12.917
At this rate, the chakra that Naruto gave
to everyone is meaningless.

13:16.917 --> 13:19.467
W-What is this?!

13:20.797 --> 13:22.667
Chakra first originated with...

13:23.007 --> 13:24.547
this Divine Tree!

13:25.007 --> 13:26.877
All the chakra here...

13:27.917 --> 13:30.837
Even the enormous amounts
of chakra you possess.

13:30.877 --> 13:32.047
What?

13:32.377 --> 13:35.507
Humans stole chakra from
the Divine Tree long ago.

13:35.967 --> 13:39.087
It's just trying to take back
what belongs to it.

13:39.877 --> 13:40.877
What are you talking about?!

13:41.757 --> 13:46.547
The endless passing of time
has cast a fog over the truth.

13:47.797 --> 13:51.797
Do you know how shinobi
came to be, Hashirama?

13:53.967 --> 13:59.127
Long ago, when people didn't
even have a concept of chakra...

14:00.877 --> 14:05.587
... even then, people still battled
each other.

14:08.087 --> 14:10.837
The Divine Tree was never involved
in their battles

14:10.837 --> 14:15.917
and was worshipped as
a sacred pillar.

14:17.377 --> 14:18.667
But one day...

14:21.337 --> 14:23.717
The Divine Tree bore a fruit
that was said to be produced

14:23.797 --> 14:25.257
only once in a millennium.

14:25.337 --> 14:29.587
I don't know what it signified,
but legend dictated

14:29.667 --> 14:32.377
that no one was to ever
lay hands on the fruit.

14:35.837 --> 14:38.877
But one princess, in her desire

14:38.967 --> 14:42.917
to reap the power of
the Divine Tree to win a war,

14:43.007 --> 14:45.257
took and consumed the forbidden fruit.

14:47.587 --> 14:49.547
Afterwards, she gained
the power of a god,

14:49.627 --> 14:52.667
and it was said she quashed
the war by herself.

14:53.837 --> 14:58.087
Her name was Kaguya Otsutsuki.

14:59.797 --> 15:00.917
So that's how!

15:02.587 --> 15:05.087
She was the first human
to have chakra.

15:07.337 --> 15:09.667
Eventually, Kaguya would bear a child

15:09.757 --> 15:13.417
who was born with chakra
already within him.

15:15.047 --> 15:18.087
However, the Divine Tree
came alive

15:18.167 --> 15:21.217
and went on a rampage
in order to reclaim its stolen chakra.

15:22.007 --> 15:23.797
That is the Ten Tails.

15:25.297 --> 15:29.047
And the one who stopped it
was Kaguya's child.

15:29.417 --> 15:32.217
His name was Hagoromo Otsutsuki.

15:33.837 --> 15:36.547
He was the one who preached
the teachings of chakra,

15:36.627 --> 15:38.587
and was the founder of Ninshu.

15:39.047 --> 15:40.547
He was the forefather of the shinobi—

15:40.627 --> 15:42.587
the man known as
the Sage of Six Paths.

15:43.967 --> 15:46.757
How do you know all of this?!

15:47.917 --> 15:50.837
It was inscribed on
the Uchiha Stone Tablet.

15:54.297 --> 15:56.917
Do I need to explain what happened

15:57.007 --> 15:59.967
to those who tasted of
the forbidden fruit...

16:00.047 --> 16:02.297
for the purpose of ending all conflict?

16:07.877 --> 16:11.007
That's right...
It didn't change anything.

16:11.377 --> 16:14.667
In fact, subsequent wars
become more gruesome!

16:15.877 --> 16:19.047
Upon learning this,
I fell into despair.

16:20.127 --> 16:24.087
There are no such things as true dreams
in this world, Hashirama!

16:25.297 --> 16:29.217
Ever since people tasted that fruit,
humans have been cursed...

16:29.297 --> 16:32.257
And destined to hate
each other even more!

16:34.587 --> 16:36.877
And it is we shinobi
whose very existence

16:36.967 --> 16:40.047
symbolizes that foolishness,
don't you think?

16:41.167 --> 16:42.797
In which case I'd rather...

16:43.507 --> 16:45.967
So relying on the power
of the Divine Tree again

16:46.047 --> 16:47.717
by using a great genjutsu...

16:49.257 --> 16:51.337
<i>You just can't see it...</i>

16:51.917 --> 16:53.837
<i>What's beyond this...</i>

16:53.837 --> 16:55.627
<i>The dreams of the far future.</i>

17:01.587 --> 17:04.877
Is this what you meant
by "dreams of the far future"?!

17:07.087 --> 17:07.967
Yes...

17:08.627 --> 17:11.627
But it will be a little different.

17:16.047 --> 17:17.257
Naruto!

17:19.257 --> 17:21.667
Water Style: Severing Wave!

17:27.877 --> 17:29.667
Damn it! There are too many of them!

17:30.257 --> 17:32.717
<i>I might be able to sense Naruto,</i>
<i>but it's useless!</i>

17:33.337 --> 17:36.297
Fourth! Can you teleport directly
to Naruto?!

17:37.087 --> 17:42.007
I can't! That last Flying Raijin
and these vines have drained my chakra!

17:42.967 --> 17:44.297
In that case...

17:49.877 --> 17:52.837
Let go... of me...

18:01.377 --> 18:02.507
<i>Gramps...</i>

18:05.837 --> 18:08.047
Sorry it took so long!

18:08.547 --> 18:09.337
Oh!

18:09.667 --> 18:10.417
Saru!

18:13.217 --> 18:13.917
All right!

18:14.007 --> 18:15.507
We're teleporting out of here!

18:23.507 --> 18:25.047
Have things finally settled down?

19:19.017 --> 19:22.567
Is this what you meant by
"dreams of the far future"?!

19:23.107 --> 19:24.067
Yes...

19:24.817 --> 19:26.817
But it will be a little different.

19:28.027 --> 19:29.067
"A little different"?

19:29.907 --> 19:30.907
Take a look...

19:42.957 --> 19:45.587
When the Divine Tree's bud
finally blooms...

19:46.717 --> 19:49.927
The moon will reflect the eye
at the flower's center, up above...

19:50.887 --> 19:53.557
and the Infinite Tsukuyomi
will be fully activated...

19:53.847 --> 19:58.847
And I... will be the one
to accomplish it.

19:59.597 --> 20:01.607
We're doomed!

20:02.147 --> 20:03.647
This is crazy...

20:05.067 --> 20:06.237
Miss Sakura!

20:06.317 --> 20:08.357
Are you all right, Miss Sakura?

20:14.077 --> 20:17.657
That was a close call, fool! Ya fool!

20:18.827 --> 20:20.077
That was too close!

20:23.587 --> 20:25.337
Is it over?

20:43.397 --> 20:47.607
Now, be still...

20:51.987 --> 20:53.947
You have all...

20:56.697 --> 20:58.957
